<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Harnischfeger cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Harnischfeger cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers analysts Jennifer Cole and Christopher Winham said they lowered their rating on Harnischfeger Industries Inc to hold from buy and set 12-month target price of $45 to $47.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We are lowering our rating ... to reflect the strong appreciation in the stock over the past few days and months,&quot; the analysts said in a research note.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe that the market is fully valuing Harnischfeger's earnings prospects over the next two years as it continues on the track of sales growth and profitability improvement,&quot; they said.</p>
<p>-- Shares were unchanged at 46.</p>
</text>
